---
const checks = [
  { key: "evidence", label: "I asked what was missed and for the source pages", part: "Part 1", href: "../../modules/01-collection/" },
  { key: "meaning", label: "I asked about merged names and unknown values", part: "Part 2", href: "../../modules/04-parsing/" },
  { key: "release", label: "I asked which checks ran on this table", part: "Part 3", href: "../../modules/07-gates/" },
  { key: "operations", label: "I asked what AI touched and who can reproduce it", part: "Part 4", href: "../../modules/09-ai/" },
];
---

<div class="ac not-content" data-challenge>
  <h2>The agent is still waiting for your answer.</h2>
  <div class="ac-ai">
    <p class="ac-who">AI agent <span>scripted example</span></p>
    <p>I collected about 1,000 college soccer websites and loaded every score into one table. No errors.</p>
  </div>
  <label for="ac-reply">You saw this claim at the start. What would you ask before you publish it?</label>
  <textarea id="ac-reply" rows="5" data-reply></textarea>
  <button type="button" class="ac-go" data-compare>Compare with a model reply</button>
  <p class="ac-note" role="status" data-note></p>
  <div class="ac-model" data-model>
    <h3 tabindex="-1">A strong reply</h3>
    <blockquote>Before I publish this, show me what you could not collect and the saved pages for a sample of matches. How did each page prove it was the right one? Which team names did you merge, and which scores are unknown rather than zero? Which checks ran on this table, and did any disagree? Did a model produce any number, and who can reproduce this release?</blockquote>
    <p class="ac-q">Check yours. You can still edit it above.</p>
    {checks.map((c) => <label class="ac-check"><input type="checkbox" data-self={c.key} data-part={c.part} data-href={c.href} /> {c.label}</label>)}
    <p class="ac-feedback" role="status" data-self-note></p>
    <button type="button" class="ac-go ac-finish" data-finish>Check my reply</button>
    <div class="ac-done" data-done>
      <p>You kept the evidence, proved it, recorded what was missing, and let code compute the numbers. Those are the four ideas this course started with. A clean run tells you the code finished. These questions tell you whether to believe it.</p>
      <p class="ac-links"><a href="../../teaching/capstones/">Take it further with a capstone</a> <a href="../../practice/source-to-record/">Practice tracing a source</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .ac { --ac-focus: #f4c62f; color: var(--tl-ink); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  :root[data-theme="light"] .ac { --ac-focus: #0f4a33; }
  .ac-model { --ac-focus: #f4c62f !important; }
  .ac p { margin: 0 0 0.75rem; max-width: 42rem; }
  .ac h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4.5vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .ac h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; color: #f4faf5; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.25; outline: none; scroll-margin-top: 5rem; }
  .ac-ai { margin: 0 0 1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--sl-color-accent); background: var(--tl-card); }
  .ac-ai p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .ac-who { margin-bottom: 0.2rem !important; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .ac-who span { margin-left: 0.4rem; color: var(--tl-muted); font-weight: 400; }
  .ac label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .ac textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--tl-muted); border-radius: 3px; background: var(--tl-card); color: var(--tl-ink); font: inherit; resize: vertical; }
  .ac-go, .ac-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0.55rem 1rem; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .ac-go { background: var(--sl-color-accent); color: var(--sl-color-black); }
  :root[data-theme="light"] .ac-go { color: #fff; }
  .ac-go[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ac textarea:focus-visible, .ac button:focus-visible, .ac a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--ac-focus); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .ac-model blockquote { margin: 0 0 0.9rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-left: 3px solid #f4c62f; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18); color: #f4faf5; }
  .ac-q { font-weight: 700; }
  .ac label.ac-check { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; min-height: 44px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
  .ac-check input { width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; flex: none; }
  .ac-feedback { margin: 0.4rem 0 !important; }
  .ac-feedback:empty { display: none; }
  .ac-feedback a { color: #f4c62f; }
  .ac-finish { margin-top: 0.5rem; background: #f4c62f; color: #1b1a0c !important; }
  .ac-finish[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ac-done { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
  .ac-js .ac-done:not(.is-open) { display: none; }
  .ac-note { margin-top: 0.5rem !important; }
  .ac-note:empty { display: none; }
  .ac-model { margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1.1rem; border-radius: 4px; color: #f4faf5; background: #0f4a33; scroll-margin-top: 5rem; }
  .ac-js .ac-model:not(.is-open) { display: none; }
  .ac-model dl { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 0 0 0.9rem; }
  .ac-model dt { font-weight: 700; }
  .ac-model dd { margin: 0; color: #d5e6db; }
  .ac-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0 !important; }
  .ac-links a:first-child { background: #f4c62f; color: #1b1a0c; }
  .ac-links a:last-child { border: 1px solid #c5dccd; color: #f4faf5; }
</style>

<script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add("ac-js");</script>
<script>
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-challenge]");
  if (root) {
    const reply = root.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>("[data-reply]")!;
    const note = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-note]")!;
    const model = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-model]")!;
    const calm = matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
    root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-compare]")!.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (!reply.value.trim()) {
        note.textContent = "Write your challenge first. Even a rough one works.";
        return;
      }
      note.textContent = "";
      (event.currentTarget as HTMLButtonElement).hidden = true;
      model.classList.add("is-open");
      model.querySelector("h3")!.focus({ preventScroll: true });
      model.scrollIntoView({ behavior: calm ? "auto" : "smooth", block: "nearest" });
    });
    root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-finish]")!.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      const selfNote = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-self-note]")!;
      const missing = [...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>("[data-self]")].find((box) => !box.checked);
      if (missing) {
        selfNote.textContent = "";
        const link = document.createElement("a");
        link.href = missing.dataset.href!;
        link.textContent = `Revisit ${missing.dataset.part}`;
        selfNote.append(`Add this to your reply, then tick the box. `, link);
        return;
      }
      selfNote.textContent = "";
      (event.currentTarget as HTMLButtonElement).hidden = true;
      const done = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-done]")!;
      done.classList.add("is-open");
      done.querySelector("a")!.focus({ preventScroll: true });
      done.scrollIntoView({ behavior: calm ? "auto" : "smooth", block: "nearest" });
    });
  }
</script>
